Do not import anything under this tree as a standalone skill.

These SKILL.md files belong to the `docstore` PLUGIN. Claude Code loads them
through the plugin (namespaced `docstore:<skill>`). Copying or symlinking them
into .claude/skills/, ~/.claude/skills/ or ~/.agents/skills/ produces a DOUBLE
LISTING: the same skill offered twice, once namespaced and once bare, with
competing trigger descriptions.

Layout:  plugins/docstore/claude/   <- Claude Code plugin (this one)
         plugins/docstore/codex/    <- Codex variant (planned)

The plugin is consumed via the symlink ~/.claude/local-plugins/plugins/docstore
-> plugins/docstore/claude, registered in the casebible-local marketplace.

